{"repo": {"timestamp": 1793215238000, "version": 20002, "name": "CokieVault", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://Wonkoly.github.io/cokievault-fdroid/fdroid/repo", "description": "Repositorio oficial de CokieVault (finanzas personales con IA).", "mirrors": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Wonkoly/cokievault-fdroid/master/fdroid/repo"]}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"antiFeatures": ["NonFreeNet"], "authorName": "galleta", "categories": ["Money"], "suggestedVersionName": "1.3.1", "suggestedVersionCode": "14301", "license": "Unknown", "name": "CokieVault", "added": 1793169865000, "packageName": "dev.cokie.cokievault", "lastUpdated": 1793215213000, "localized": {"en-US": {"description": "CokieVault keeps track of your income and expenses on your phone (no servers) and uses Google Gemini to:\n\n* Log expenses in plain language (\u201cDinner 25\u201d)\n* Read one or several bank statements (PDF or photo) and import their transactions without duplicates\n* Create, edit or delete transactions, reminders, budgets and goals in plain language\n* Analyze your month and suggest where to save\n* Answer questions about your finances\n\nPlus: home-screen balance widget, notifications for upcoming bills and exceeded budgets, balance projection, statistics, budgets with alerts, recurring transactions, savings goals, bill reminders, PIN lock, backup/CSV export, light/dark themes and Spanish, English and French.\n", "summary": "AI-powered personal finance: expenses, budgets, goals and bank statements"}, "es": {"description": "CokieVault registra tus ingresos y gastos en tu tel\u00e9fono (sin servidores) y usa Google Gemini para:\n\n* Registrar gastos escribiendo en lenguaje natural (\u00abCena 250\u00bb)\n* Leer uno o varios estados de cuenta (PDF o foto) e importar sus movimientos sin duplicarlos\n* Crear, corregir o borrar movimientos, recordatorios, presupuestos y metas habl\u00e1ndole normal\n* Analizar tu mes y sugerir d\u00f3nde ahorrar\n* Responder preguntas sobre tus finanzas\n\nAdem\u00e1s: widget de saldo para la pantalla de inicio, notificaciones de pagos por vencer y presupuestos excedidos, proyecci\u00f3n de saldo, estad\u00edsticas, presupuestos con alertas, movimientos recurrentes, metas de ahorro, recordatorios de pago, bloqueo con PIN, respaldo/exportaci\u00f3n CSV, temas claro/oscuro y espa\u00f1ol, ingl\u00e9s y franc\u00e9s.\n", "summary": "Finanzas personales con IA: gastos, presupuestos, metas y estados de cuenta"}, "fr-FR": {"description": "CokieVault suit vos revenus et d\u00e9penses sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9phone (sans serveur) et utilise Google Gemini pour saisir des d\u00e9penses en langage naturel, lire vos relev\u00e9s bancaires (PDF ou photo), analyser votre mois et r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 vos questions. Avec statistiques, budgets, op\u00e9rations r\u00e9currentes, objectifs d'\u00e9pargne, rappels, verrouillage par PIN, sauvegarde et export CSV.\n", "summary": "Finances personnelles avec IA : d\u00e9penses, budgets, objectifs et relev\u00e9s"}}}], "packages": {"dev.cokie.cokievault": [{"added": 1793215213000, "apkName": "cokievault-1.3.1-x86_64.apk", "hash": "be9b6c178addefe043e888c7ee18659e8b875605a7b303299560bbe6f6880965", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 24, "nativecode": ["x86_64"], "packageName": "dev.cokie.cokievault", "sig": "6ab0e27d40c76b4e03e064af8f372c94", "signer": "a4baaefe862c7e2196ffd96ac3eb55d2e35ac43b2e9d65e2729ccd75c63740e8", "size": 57188938, "targetSdkVersion": 36, "uses-permission": [["android.permission.INTERNET", null], ["android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS", null], ["android.permission.WAKE_LOCK", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE", null], ["android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE", null], ["dev.cokie.cokievault.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION", null]], "versionCode": 14301, "versionName": "1.3.1"}, {"added": 1793207023000, "apkName": "cokievault-1.3.0-x86_64.apk", "hash": "66dc379